<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/consumer">Consumer Electronics</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Consumer Electronics products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/consumer/smt-sensors" aria-label="SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly" aria-current="page"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">SS</span><span class="label">SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/consumer/wireless-charging" aria-label="Wireless Charging"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">WC</span><span class="label">Wireless Charging</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the device does and the volumes you expect and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Consumer Electronics &middot; SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly</div><h1 class="mk-h1">PCBA and sensor packaging for consumer electronics</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana assembles high-density consumer PCBAs and miniaturized sensor assemblies on fine-pitch SMT lines, with inspection integrated throughout the process and functional test available to program requirements.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-smt-sensors" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><img src="/images/photos/mk-consumer-electronics-card-smt-sensors.webp" alt="Consumer PCBA and packaged sensor assemblies" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" /></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-smt-sensors" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Consumer SMT programs draw on the same microelectronics assembly processes used across Hana's sensor and IC manufacturing operations.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Fine-pitch consumer PCBAs</span></div><div class="desc">High-volume SMT assembly using 01005 passives and micro-BGA or WLCSP packages down to 0.2 mm pitch, with placement accuracy to ±18 µm on panels up to 440 × 600 mm.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Miniaturized sensor assemblies</span></div><div class="desc">Assembly of sensor die and packaged sensors onto or within the PCBA, supported by Hana's broader microelectronics and sensor-assembly capabilities. Package examples include QFN, DFN and LGA sensor packages and hermetic ceramic sensor packages.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Inspection coverage on every board</span></div><div class="desc">Solder paste inspection before placement, automated optical inspection around the reflow process and X-ray inspection for hidden solder joints.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Functional test on the line</span></div><div class="desc">Acoustic, Bluetooth, wireless and GPS functional testing available to program requirements.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Further process detail covering EMS and OSAT services can be explored below:</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/smt-assembly">Explore SMT Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a><a href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly/mems-sensor-assembly">Explore MEMS &amp; Sensor Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-plate pl-fade" data-plate-role="capability"><div class="art"><img src="/images/plate-smt-sensor-assembly.webp" alt=""/></div><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Process control for compact assemblies</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Each production flow is configured around the package, board design and required volume, with vacuum reflow under nitrogen available where the component and joint requirements call for it. Combined with inspection at each stage of the line, this configuration supports consistent production across dense consumer PCBAs and sensor assemblies.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2></div><div class="mk-locs c4"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What consumer products can Hana assemble for?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Compact, dense consumer hardware — wearables, Bluetooth audio, smart-home hubs, remote controls, chargers and connected home devices — supplied as bare PCBAs or as complete, tested units. We do not name the brands we build for.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana hold quality at consumer volumes?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Inspection is integrated into the production flow. Solder paste inspection runs before placement, automated optical inspection covers the reflow process, and X-ray is used for hidden joints. Functional testing is added where required by the program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How small can Hana place and package?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">The fine-pitch envelope runs to 01005 passives and micro-BGA and WLCSP packages at 0.2 mm pitch, placed to ±18 µm, on panels up to 440 × 600 mm. What a given program uses is confirmed with our team against the board.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/markets/consumer" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Consumer Electronics market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your consumer SMT program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>

